{"id":"n67864-1-3","stage":2,"title":"요새 · 近来","scene":"说明与表达","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n67864-1-3-1","ko":"요새는 입맛이 통 없어.","zh":"最近我完全没胃口啊。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"요새는","meaning":"近来，日来，最近","explanation":"요새：近来，日来，最近；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"요새","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67864","senseId":"1","lemma":"요새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"요새는","audio":"/audio/bdbdb91b6843e6c1a63c.mp3"}},{"text":"입맛이","meaning":"口味，胃口，食欲","explanation":"입맛：口味，胃口，食欲；이：主格助词，标记主语。","readings":[{"term":"입맛","audio":"/audio/b0e5bfd702c70372139f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"24617","senseId":"1","lemma":"입맛","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"입맛이","audio":"/audio/2f4e0e8321df0a1c1916.mp3"}},{"text":"통","meaning":"完全","explanation":"통：完全。","readings":[{"term":"통","audio":"/audio/837d5d028930fb39e15f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"81476","senseId":"2","lemma":"통","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"통","audio":"/audio/837d5d028930fb39e15f.mp3"}},{"text":"없어.","meaning":"没有","explanation":"없다：没有；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"없다","audio":"/audio/815560dcd5b828930ac0.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"89917","senseId":"3","lemma":"없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"없어","audio":"/audio/d3275bf98baed4550c12.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"2e1177912c702a7a","term":"요새","zh":"近来，日来，最近","audio":"/audio/2e1177912c702a7aa0da.mp3","entryId":"67864","definition":"从不久前到现在的非常短的期间。","pronunciation":["요새"]},{"id":"b0e5bfd702c70372","term":"입맛","zh":"口味，胃口，食欲","audio":"/audio/b0e5bfd702c70372139f.mp3","entryId":"24617","definition":"吃食物使嘴里感受到的味道，或指想吃食物的欲望。","pronunciation":["임맏"]},{"id":"837d5d028930fb39","term":"통","zh":"完全","audio":"/audio/837d5d028930fb39e15f.mp3","entryId":"81476","definition":"全部都。","pronunciation":["통"]},{"id":"815560dcd5b82893","term":"없